    ┏ Finish later? ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
    ┃Until the recovery key for “Mara's workspace” is written down, losing ┃
    ┃your passkey locks you out of the changes that need it: who's in the  ┃
    ┃workspace, their roles, devices and keys.                             ┃
    ┃These words are shown only now. You can make a new recovery key later ┃
    ┃from the desktop app (Settings, Passkeys & keys).                     ┃
    ┃                                                                      ┃
    ┃  › [ Keep going ]     [ Finish later ]                               ┃
    ┃                                                                      ┃
    ┃enter keep going · f finish later                                     ┃
